{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52563","headline":"潜珠篇 · 宋之问","name":"潜珠篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜光四寸今所无，闻有入海求大珠。\n大珠自爱潜不发，希世一见比明月。\n灵物变化讵可寻？几人皓首死闽越。\n泥蟠沙卧海底沉，何知结爱美人心。\n可怜曜乘十二乘，谁惜黄金七百金。\n越乡祈宝诚非易，涉险捐躯名与义。\n天生至宝自无伦，如何真僞人莫分。\n古来贵耳而贱目，恐君既见不及闻。\n世有南山采薇子，从来道气凌白云。\n今乃千里作一尉，无媒爲献明圣君。\n（同前七一页）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52563.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52563","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}